      "note": "Public pricing lists GLM-4.7-Flash, GLM-4.5-Flash, and GLM-4.6V-Flash product labels at zero input/output price, but the current official Chat Completion model enum does not list these Flash labels; only non-Flash IDs glm-4.7 and glm-4.6 are enumerated, and their price/entitlement is not established as free. No authenticated account catalog confirms Flash request IDs. Account quotas remain unverified. API Additional Terms prohibit decision-making activities with undefined scope; retention is not established as zero. No autonomous-agent use until written provider clarification. No live adapter, credentials, inference, or paid fallback."
